title Vinyl Knock-knock: the Menu where the launcher answers screen: the Knock-knock row in TOOLS, under the Sleep timer (Off); a tap turns it On, Enter Off again; the Playback page has no such row
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640 1280x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE menu
env VINYL_DEMO_SCREEN 1

wait 900
shot 01-menu-knock-off
expect text "Knock-knock"
expect text "Sleep timer"
tap "Knock-knock"
wait 400
shot 02-menu-knock-on
key enter
wait 400
shot 03-menu-knock-off-again
tap "Playback"
wait 400
shot 04-playback-no-row
expect text "Gapless"
expect notext "Knock-knock"
expect noquit
